# Downloaded reference data belongs to the machine, not the repository.
#
# This directory holds ~286 MB of GeoNames, Census and CHR&R files. All of it is
# reproducible from lookups/00_fetch_reference_data.py, none of it is small, and
# a `git add .` without this file would have committed the lot.
#
# The scripts stay tracked; everything else is ignored.

*
!.gitignore
!*.py
